OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed after raping woman he
OL,4,Amet on dating app
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was raped after meeting a
OL,7,Fman on a dating app said it left her
OL,8,F"not being able to trust people like I
OL,9,Fused to".
OL,11,FLeon Walker, 38, from Yeovil in
OL,12,FSomerset, was sentenced to four years
OL,13,Fand three months in prison at Taunton
OL,14,FCrown Court on 11 September after being
OL,15,Ffound guilty by a jury of one count of
OL,16,Frape in July. He was acquitted of two
OL,17,Fother counts.
OL,19,FIn her victim personal statement, read
OL,20,Fout at the sentencing hearing, the
OL,21,Fwoman said: "I had to rebuild my
OL,22,Fconfidence in meeting new people".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
