OL,5,
OL,6,FPC Jake Whatley, the investigating
OL,7,Fofficer from Avon and Somerset Police,
OL,8,Fsaid the conviction reflects "the
OL,9,Fcourage and determination shown by the
OL,10,Fvictim".
